# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 8 and 9: the clause `? 3` chooses stands at the child's 0 and 1, the `match`'s arm at 2; each is forwarded at 0/[p]/0, and a click on the forwarded button reaches the child in its tick.
test hosted_clauses

tick 0
  added:
    0/[0]/0: Ui.Label(text="some 3")
    0/[1]/0: Ui.Button(label="pick 3")
    0/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="total 0")

tick 1
  in:
    0/[1]/0: click
  changed:
    0/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="total 3")
